  description: "Apply the following effect, 3 times, in sequence.\r\n\u25CF Each
    player reveals 1 monster from their Deck that does not have ? ATK. Add the monster
    with the higher ATK to the hand of the player that revealed it, also destroy
    the monster with the lower ATK and inflict 500 damage to the player that revealed
    it. If tied, shuffle those monsters into the Decks.\r\nFor the rest of this turn,
    neither player can activate the effects of monsters with any of their revealed
    monsters' names. You can only activate 1 \"Subspace Battle\" per turn."
